direction: right
title: Databricks Asset Bundles (DAB) CI/CD Architecture

Dev: 1. Developer Workstation {
  style.stroke: "#38BDF8"
  Config: databricks.yml (IaC Bundle Definition)
  Val: databricks bundle validate
  DeployDev: databricks bundle deploy -t dev
  Config -> Val -> DeployDev
}

Git: 2. Git Pull Request {
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
  PR: Peer Review & Automated Unit Tests
}

CICD: 3. CI/CD Runner (GitHub Actions / ADO) {
  style.stroke: "#C084FC"
  OIDC: Authenticates via Cloud OIDC
  DeployProd: databricks bundle deploy -t prod
  OIDC -> DeployProd
}

Prod: 4. Governed Prod Workspace {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  SP: Owned by Service Principal
  Workflows: Production Workflows & DLT DAGs
  SP -> Workflows
}

Dev.DeployDev -> Git.PR: Git Push & Open PR { style.stroke: "#FBBF24" }
Git.PR -> CICD.OIDC: Merge to main branch { style.stroke: "#C084FC" }
CICD.DeployProd -> Prod.SP: Deploys assets { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
